": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ORj-VePVNGkQ7kNvwHix5RL&_nc_oc=Ado1LDVeB0JBBEdD5frEJh6Xb5Xr0xhRIorHmz8sbk52oZh5LtUeCxfPJSvEHP84dJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGn93Gfm0dijbf9KTsW4ewNNdF1_USUA3UeCehBRXraZA&oe=6A73275B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fQuxP4RuPyAQ7kNvwF39aEr&_nc_oc=AdpzH2uNl6-oGC_9hdzPe8VQ4_mE_TA6THXPpTU11KJ29jB9z9uY33BAyoTmVF-x6rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFEDb8fskLLsfyFTX60FC8xWln1_SYZN4kEOPdtjjMRow&oe=6A734FE1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aEI0LOpYcpwQ7kNvwEpP2sV&_nc_oc=Adrx30UYs8dyDVKbbMaiBY7ncF7KbxvNuvRjUe8IzpplPDxkhqrrCce79eeQ1y-srlo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFT6sf7w-CShOnNx2P9s5zbweDrcgfbbOp0TRBqIetdMQ&oe=6A733CAF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gi2TQ_Ha-XcQ7kNvwFCn_cl&_nc_oc=AdqxLYL0Je-IP13YHpRg5pX200AYvVX6tvlKZfKbn6I8ne34IfPvWMn8Rk-SDFxNRVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEvxmv8mzwvFEFlL0k3zt4jsklKK58ffpr8O9ndTKDEyQ&oe=6A733C52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wTx1bjI_MSAQ7kNvwGlzHlw&_nc_oc=Adq_caCblYh1-cON4E9t7yKZ0c7JZEnBxD5LUmNn-AMDomikIJ_4zOVMJ410pBKE8nA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGW8u1Ve5yx5W9nnRlwjBmBoezrs3rMetCHbmWU30rxdA&oe=6A7345FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a